Ginkgo CADx authors
===================

Original development:
  MetaEmotion S.L. (2008-2014)

Maintainers of the free version:
  Gert Wollny <gw.fossdev@gmail.com> (2015-2019; Debian packaging, C++11,
    GTK3, DCMTK 3.6.4)
  SgAkErRu <sulmpx60@yandex.ru> (2024; multi-select download, Y-m-d dates,
    AppImage recipe)
  ayush-bharti <ayush.bharti@gmail.com> (2026-; panacea-india fork, move to
    current libraries and VTK 9)

Other contributors:
  Gianfranco Costamagna <costamagnagianfranco@yahoo.it>
